  o Major bugfixes (worker threads):
    - Fix a type-confusion crash when freeing a thread pool: the whole
      update-argument array was passed to the free function as if it
      were a single argument, so an update left unconsumed at shutdown
      could send a bogus pointer into the onion-key free path. Also
      free work items still queued at shutdown, which were previously
      leaked. Fixes bug 41209; bugfix on 0.4.8.13.
